01:46:21.260 --> 01:46:22.510
So if we can just finish this algorithm.

01:46:22.510 --> 01:46:24.270
Good.

01:46:24.270 --> 01:46:26.070
Not good.

01:46:26.070 --> 01:46:27.600
OK, 6 and 2, not good.

