02:07:24.960 --> 02:07:25.460
Whew.

02:07:25.460 --> 02:07:26.120
That was a lot.

02:07:26.120 --> 02:07:26.960
Let's call it a day.

02:07:26.960 --> 02:07:28.040
I'll stick around for
